### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@email = testuser@example.com
@password = Password123!
@fullName = Test User

### 0. Reset Database
POST {{baseUrl}}/test/reset-db

### 1. Register User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "full_name": "{{fullName}}"
}

###

### 2. Login User
# Note: OAuth2 Password flow uses form-urlencoded format, not JSON!
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{email}}&password={{password}}

###

### Extract Token Variable from Login Response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

###

### 3. Get Current User Profile (/me)
# Requires valid Authorization header
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 4. Test Invalid Login (Negative Test Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{email}}&password=wrongpassword

###

### 5. Test Access /me Without Token (Should Return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me